sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-runions-pavement-cell-lobing> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-runions-pavement-cell-lobing-code-traceability> .
